# bucket-brigade driver checkpoint artifacts (written to CWD/repo root by the
# train_nfsp / train_psro examples; multi-MB Burn policy dumps — never commit).
# Anchored to repo root so legitimate .bin/.json under web/ or tests/ are unaffected.
/nfsp_*_final_*.bin
/nfsp_*_final_*.json
/psro_*_final_*.bin
/psro_*_final_*.json
/psro_*_iter*_agent*.bin
/psro_*_iter*_meta_nash.json
